.SH "نام (NAME)"
ospent \- Concatenates entities in an SGML/XML document
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.HP \w'\fBospent\fR\ 'u
\fBospent\fR [\fB\-ChnrRv\fR] [\fB\-b\fR\fB\fIbctf\fR\fR] [\fB\-c\fR\fB\fIsysid\fR\fR] [\fB\-f\fR\fB\fIfile\fR\fR] [\fB\-D\fR\fB\fIdirectory\fR\fR] [\fIsysid\fR...]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.PP
\fBospent\fR
(OpenSP print entity) prints the concatenation of the entities with system identifiers
.HP \w'\ 'u [\fIsysid\fR...]
on the standard output\&.
.PP
The following options are available:
.PP
\fB\-b\fR\fB\fIbctf\fR\fR, \fB\-\-bctf=\fR\fB\fIbctf\fR\fR
.RS 4
Use the BCTF with name
\fIbctf\fR
for output\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-c\fR\fB\fIsysid\fR\fR, \fB\-\-catalog=\fR\fB\fIsysid\fR\fR
.RS 4
Map public identifiers and entity names to system identifiers using the catalog entry file whose system identifier is
\fIsysid\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-C\fR, \fB\-\-catalogs\fR
.RS 4
This has the same effect as in
\fBonsgmls(1)\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-D\fR\fB\fIdirectory\fR\fR, \fB\-\-directory=\fR\fB\fIdirectory\fR\fR
.RS 4
Search directory for files specified in system identifiers\&. This has the same effect as in
\fBonsgmls(1)\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-f\fR\fB\fIfile\fR\fR, \fB\-\-error\-file=\fR\fB\fIfile\fR\fR
.RS 4
Redirect error messages to
\fIfile\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
.RS 4
Display a help text and exit\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-n\fR, \fB\-\-non\-sgml\fR
.RS 4
The entity is a non\-SGML data entity\&. This option forces the octets in the storage objects comprising the entity to be copied exactly without any of the conversions that are done for text entities\&. Implies
\fB\-r\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-r\fR, \fB\-\-raw\fR
.RS 4
Raw output\&. Don\*(Aqt perform any conversion on RSs and REs when printing the entity\&. The entity would typically have the storage manager attribute records=asis\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-R\fR, \fB\-\-restricted\fR
.RS 4
This has the same effect as in
\fBonsgmls(1)\fR\&.
.RE
.PP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-version\fR
.RS 4
Print the version number\&.
.RE
